The '''Primordial Bat''' is a [[Mob]] that spawns in groups when fighting a {{SlayerTier|IV}} or {{SlayerTier|V}} {{MobSprite|Tarantula Broodfather}}.

== Spawning ==
The {{SlayerTier|IV}} and {{SlayerTier|V}} {{MobSprite|Tarantula Broodfather}} will periodically spawn a horde of '''Primordial Bats'''.

