== Behavior ==
'''Primordial Bats''' slowly float around, dealing {{Red|0.1%}} ({{SlayerTier|4}}) / {{Red|0.2%}} ({{SlayerTier|5}}) of the player's max {{Stat|Health}} as {{Stat|Damage}} every second. They are also immune to {{DamageType|Magic}}.

